{
  "$schema": "https://cardz.roderic.dev/designs/schema.json",
  "Name": "My FreeCell",
  "Description": "**Goal:** build all four foundations up from Ace to King, each in a single suit.\n\n- Tableau columns build **down in alternating colour** (e.g. a red 6 on a black 7).\n- You move strictly **one card at a time**. A run already in alternating-colour order can be dragged as a group, but only as many cards as you could move by hand: **(1 + free cells) × 2 for each empty column**. Free a cell or clear a column to move a longer run.\n- Each of the four **free cells** holds a single card — use them as temporary parking.",
  "Decks": [
    {}
  ],
